
# Button group — headless. Groups buttons into a segmented control. Theme the joined borders/radius in CSS.
load @term/site/code/view/render
  find element
load @term/site/code/dom/dom
  find view
  find append

view button-group
  take host, like view
  take class
  view div
    bind data-slot, text <button-group>
    bind class, read class
    slot
